 tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"popis-aplikace-tab\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                                                            <span class=\"eael-tab-title title-after-icon\" >Popis aplikace<\/span>                                                    <\/li>\n                                            <li id=\"ada-neascope\" class=\"inactive eael-tab-item-trigger eael-tab-nav-item\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-tab=\"2\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"ada-neascope-tab\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                                                            <span class=\"eael-tab-title title-after-icon\" >\u0158ada neaSCOPE<\/span>                                                    <\/li>\n                                    <\/ul>\n            <\/div>\n            \n            <div class=\"eael-tabs-content\">\n\t\t        \n                    <div id=\"popis-aplikace-tab\" class=\"clearfix eael-tab-content-item inactive\" data-title-link=\"popis-aplikace-tab\">\n\t\t\t\t        <p>Infra\u010derven\u00e1 mikroskopie bl\u00edzk\u00e9ho pole umo\u017e\u0148uje studovat \u0161\u00ed\u0159en\u00ed povrchov\u00fdch vln. Sn\u00edmky bl\u00edzk\u00e9ho pole s amplitudov\u00fdm a f\u00e1zov\u00fdm rozli\u0161en\u00edm odhaluj\u00ed lok\u00e1ln\u00ed interferen\u010dn\u00ed efekty a umo\u017e\u0148uj\u00ed stanoven\u00ed komplexn\u00edho vlnov\u00e9ho vektoru povrchov\u00fdch vln. Povrchov\u00e9 vlny mohou b\u00fdt excitov\u00e1ny ve st\u0159edn\u00ed infra\u010derven\u00e9 oblasti (nap\u0159. kovov\u00e9 struktury na krystalech karbidu k\u0159em\u00edku (SiC), propaguj\u00edc\u00ed povrchov\u00e9 fononov\u00e9 polaritony, SPhP).<\/p><figure id=\"attachment_9963\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-9963\" style=\"width: 698px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-9963 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/12\/e20a6494.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"698\" height=\"664\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/12\/e20a6494.jpg 698w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/12\/e20a6494-300x285.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 698px) 100vw, 698px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-9963\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Anal\u00fdza \u0161\u00ed\u0159en\u00ed povrchov\u00fdch optick\u00fdch vln: topografie, SEM a amplituda a f\u00e1ze v bl\u00e9zk\u00e9m poli<\/figcaption><\/figure><p>\u00a0<\/p><p>Topografick\u00fd sn\u00edmek ukazuje kruhovou strukturu pou\u017e\u00edvanou k buzen\u00ed SPhPs. SPhPs se \u0161\u00ed\u0159\u00ed kolmo k okraji kovov\u00e9ho filmu a zak\u0159iven\u00e1 struktura vede k zaost\u0159ovac\u00edmu efektu vln. Sn\u00edmek amplitudy v bl\u00edzk\u00e9m poli jasn\u011b odhaluje lok\u00e1ln\u011b zes\u00edlen\u00fd sign\u00e1l asi 40 \u00b5m daleko od t\u00e9to struktury. Lze si v\u0161imnout, \u017ee kovov\u00e1 struktura je osv\u011btlena rovinnou vlnou (pou\u017e\u00edvanou k buzen\u00ed SPhPs), kter\u00e1 zasahuje do pole povrchov\u00fdch vln. Infra\u010dervenou mikroskopii bl\u00edzk\u00e9ho pole lze tak efektivn\u011b pou\u017e\u00edt pro amplitudov\u011b a f\u00e1zov\u011b rozli\u0161en\u00e9 studie (nap\u0159. \u201espoof plazmony\u201c).<\/p>                    <\/div>\n\t\t        \n                    <div id=\"ada-neascope-tab\" class=\"clearfix eael-tab-content-item inactive\" data-title-link=\"ada-neascope-tab\">\n\t\t\t\t        <style>@media(max-width:1024px){.elementor-5032 .elementor-element.elementor-element-43f4b2a9 .dce-post-item{padding:0px 0px 20px 0px;}}@media(max-width:767px){.elementor-5032 .elementor-element.elementor-element-43f4b2a9 .dce-post-item{padding:0px 0px 15px 0px;}}<\/style>\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"section\" data-elementor-id=\"5032\" class=\"elementor elementor-5032\" data-eleme